              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 17:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.7+REV.17.8+REV.17.9+REV.17.10+REV.17.11+REV.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo aneno ogwaŋ moro munyo wok i nam. Go onwaŋo nitie gi tunge apar kodi wic abirio, gi sangaria wi tunge apar no je, gi nyinge ma luwo gima k'otire kwoŋ Were m'ondiki i kisi wic mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.4+DAN.7.5+DAN.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:4-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwaŋ m'aneno no ocale kwac, tiende ocale tiendi arara, aka dhoke ocale dhok simbwor. Bulir omiyo ogwaŋ no meni pere won, gi kom pere ma dhum, kodi meni m'oasere ma dhum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acel kwoŋ wic ogwaŋ no ocale pa nigi adhola ma d'oneko go, to adhola no ocango. Piny gipi obedo gi dhier to luwo ŋey ogwaŋ no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji je jolamo bulir kwoŋbedo go oyido omiyo ogwaŋ no meni ma dhum. Jolamo ogwaŋ no bende ka jowaco ni, “Ŋa marom g'ogwaŋ me? Ŋa manyalo lwenyo gine?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:5"
          },
